sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Web Browser
    participant Firebase as Firebase Identity Platform
    participant Middleware as FastAPI Auth Middleware
    participant PG as PostgreSQL (Users Table)
    participant Endpoint as Protected Endpoint Handler

    Client->>Firebase: Sign In (Email/Password or Provider)
    Firebase-->>Client: ID Token (JWT with RS256 Signature)
    
    Client->>Middleware: Request with Authorization: Bearer <ID_TOKEN>
    Middleware->>Firebase: Verify Token Signature & Expiration (Public Keys)
    Firebase-->>Middleware: Decoded Claims (uid, email, email_verified)
    
    Middleware->>PG: Query User by firebase_uid
    alt User Exists
        PG-->>Middleware: User Record (id, role, organization_id)
    else First-Time User
        Middleware->>PG: Provision Default User & Organization (Role: Editor)
        PG-->>Middleware: Newly Provisioned User Record
    end

    Middleware->>Middleware: Evaluate RBAC Matrix
    Note over Middleware: Viewer: GET endpoints only<br/>Editor: Estimate, Upload, Calibrate<br/>Admin: Organization & User Management

    alt Permission Allowed
        Middleware->>Endpoint: Forward Request with Authenticated Context
        Endpoint-->>Client: HTTP 200 Success
    else Insufficient Privileges
        Middleware-->>Client: HTTP 403 Forbidden
    end
